OL,3,GNEWSA'My son's killers were under
OL,4,Asupervision but allowed to reoffend'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a teenager murdered on an
OL,7,FAyrshire beach has demanded answers
OL,8,Fafter it emerged that two of his son's
OL,9,Fkillers were under the supervision of
OL,10,Fsocial services at the time.
OL,12,FKayden Moy, 16, was fatally stabbed on
OL,13,FIrvine beach in May last year following
OL,14,Fa clash between rival groups of youths.
OL,16,FTwo of the three boys jailed for the
OL,17,Ffatal attack last month were under
OL,18,Fsupervision.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
