OL,3,GNEWSA'My son's killers were under
OL,4,Asupervision but allowed to reoffend'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd Paul Moy, who has met First
OL,7,FMinister John Swinney to discuss his
OL,8,Fconcerns, said he believed his son
OL,9,Fmight still be alive had action been
OL,10,Ftaken by South Lanarkshire Council.
